{"file_id":"LANG_MYOUTER_STAFF_COMMENT.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","part":1,"range":"0-49","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Boss，你是猫派还是狗派？顺便一提，我是猫派……\n阿嚏！阿嚏！不过我对猫过敏。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"“你知道Chorizo吗？那是墨西哥香肠。和鸡蛋一起煎很好吃！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"“哈、哈、哈、哈……力量训练最棒了！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"“刘海剪得太短了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“等这场仗打完，我就回老家当捕虾渔夫。\n再叫上伙伴们，大家一起买条渔船！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"“我老家有个女儿。已经很久没见她了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"“Boss，你真的很喜欢纸箱啊……我也是。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"“想改变时代，就不要盲从过去的常识。\n什么才是正确的，也要由自己来判断。\n……是这样吧，Boss？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"JPN_SELF_JUDGMENT_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"“让我们一起把这个Mother Base发展壮大吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":"MOTHER_BASE_FIXED_TERM_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"“竟然能被Boss收留……如果不需要我了，随时把我丢掉吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_REJECTED; JPN_DISCARD_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"“刚才我正想着和Boss一样的事。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“我这个不爱说话的人，还请多关照。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"JPN_TACITURN_PERSONALITY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"“您把我忘了吗？以前承蒙您关照了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_OLD_ACQUAINTANCE_NUANCE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"“口粮可不能烤过头。\n不过要是吃得半生不熟，我觉得还不如不烤更好吃。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"“我有个朋友叫Johnny，你认识他吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"“海浪和潮水的气味。让人安心啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"JPN_WAVE_TIDE_SMELL_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"“就算在战场上，穿衣服的TPO也很重要。得好好想清楚再选……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"“我喜欢时尚。兴趣是收集T恤。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":"JPN_HOBBY_TSHIRT_COLLECTION_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"“执行任务时，我喜欢用无线电CALL。\n既能听到各种情报，也会觉得自己不是孤身一人。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"“我会加油的！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"AUX_DUTY_EXPANSION_REJECTED; JPN_DIRECT_ENCOURAGEMENT"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"“一直待在这种地方，连今天是哪天都会搞不清。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"JPN_DATE_DAY_GENERIC_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"“……我被以前待过的军队、被国家背叛了。\n喂，到底有什么值得你赌上性命？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":"JPN_ARMY_AND_COUNTRY_BETRAYAL_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"“星期五给我做咖喱吧。我最喜欢咖喱了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"“看看我这胳膊有多粗。\n我在老家的掰手腕比赛里连续两届夺冠。\n再之前是亚军，不过更前一届也是冠军。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":146,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"“这世上真是什么样的人都有。来到这里以后我才真正明白。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"“如果我死了，就在来世再见吧。还作为伙伴。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"“妻子一直对我很好。也就是说，那个……这就是‘爱’吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"“哥斯达黎加产的咖啡很好喝。谢谢。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"AUX_BEST_EVER_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"“一天不擦一次枪，我就睡不着。真想赶紧彻底保养一下……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"“能帮助英雄，是我的荣幸。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"“我是在山里长大的，对大海啊船啊这些有点……呕。真想出任务……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_WANTS_MISSION_ENDING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"“什么都很火热啊。这阳光也是，在这里度过的日子也是。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"JPN_SUNLIGHT_AND_DAYS_HERE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"“我喜欢你。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"“Boss，偶尔也休息一下吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"“说实话，我对自己没什么信心。所以我才训练。我想变得更强。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"“别看我这样，我今年48岁。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":41,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"“Boss！圣诞老人根本不存在，对吧！\n那家伙非说圣诞老人存在！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"“Boss！圣诞老人是存在的，对吧！\n那家伙非说圣诞老人不存在！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"“我也想见见尼斯湖水怪或者羽蛇神啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"QUETZALCOATL_TERM_LOCALIZED_AS_羽蛇神"},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"“Amigo，庆典还没开始吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"JPN_FESTIVAL_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"“Boss，也请好好看看我们的技能啊！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"“Boss，多招些新人进来，把MSF发展得更壮大吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"“我没法兼顾工作和兴趣。因为到最后，工作本身就会变成兴趣。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"“Boss！请把我派上战场！我会干给你看！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"“今天早上的鸡蛋里有两个蛋黄。\n所以今天我要干双倍的活！……至少得有这种劲头！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"AUX_COMPLAIN_HALF_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"“请给我下命令，Boss。我不会主动行动。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"“Boss！作战前借给你的杂志，还给我……什么！！你把它留在那儿了？！\n我还没看呢！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":"JPN_NOT_READ_YET_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"“今天早上的培根特别酥脆。这样的日子感觉什么都能干好。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"“给我一个能让我认真起来的任务……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"“支援也是堂堂正正的任务！有什么需要尽管说！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""}]}